---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, UPDATED } from '../consts.js';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | ConvertKB" description="How ConvertKB handles your files, cookies and data. Files are processed in your browser and are not uploaded to our servers.">
  <div class="narrow pagehead"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p style="color:var(--muted)">Last updated: {UPDATED}</p></div>
  <div class="narrow prose" style="padding-bottom:40px">
    <h2>Your files</h2>
    <p>ConvertKB's tools process images and PDFs inside your web browser. Files you select are not uploaded to ConvertKB servers, and we do not receive, store or view them. Closing or reloading the page clears the processing memory.</p>
    <h2>Third-party libraries and fonts</h2>
    <p>To keep pages fast, some tools load open-source libraries (for example, PDF reading, HEIC decoding and text recognition) from public content delivery networks such as jsDelivr and unpkg when you use that feature. The text recognition tool also downloads language data from a public host. These requests reveal your IP address and browser details to those providers, as any web request does, but they do not include your files. Pages also load fonts from Google Fonts.</p>
    <h2>Information stored on your device</h2>
    <p>We store your theme choice and whether you dismissed the cookie notice in your browser's local storage. This is not shared with us.</p>
    <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>We may use privacy-respecting analytics to learn which pages are useful. We may also display ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other sites. You can manage personalised ads in Google's Ads Settings and learn more in Google's advertising policies. Where required, we ask for consent before setting advertising cookies.</p>
    <h2>Email you send us</h2>
    <p>If you email us, we use your message and address only to reply and to improve the site. We do not sell or share it.</p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>The site is a general-purpose utility and is not directed at children under 13.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy and will change the date above when we do.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy: <a href={'mailto:' + CONTACT_EMAIL}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
